<h1>Combine Numbers vs. <em>Training Camp Reality</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 9 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>📊 Training Camp 2026</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Every February, the NFL Scouting Combine hands out 40-yard dash times and vertical jump inches like report cards. Every August, training camp tells you whether the grades meant anything. With 2026 camps in full swing, here's how three of this class's most explosive testers are showing up on the field.</p>
</div><div class="content">
